1
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,440
Is this the one you told her about last time,

2
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,640
the paragliding base?

3
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,760
It's only been half a month and she's back in Nan'an.

4
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:14,820
And she came alone.

5
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:19,600
Is there anything in the world you don't worry about?

6
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,400
You...

7
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,220
Never mind.

8
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:24,440
But,

9
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,930
being able to do the paragliding she likes

10
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:28,900
is pretty good too.

11
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:32,690
Sometimes, living for just one moment in life is enough.

12
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,120
So,

13
00:01:35,479 --> 00:01:38,000
I am not a cheapskate.

14
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:41,400
I just like living in the moment of getting the second cup of milk tea at half price

15
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,920
and buy-three-get-one-free bread.

16
00:01:45,039 --> 00:01:45,900
What about you?

17
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:47,860
Paying in full for a house.

18
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,759
Didn't you say you like Nan'an a lot?

19
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:55,620
Do you have any plans to live here long-term?

20
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,460
I haven't thought about that.

21
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,440
Anyway, where I live depends on my mood.

22
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,320
Your mind jumps too fast.

23
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,440
Is there any connection between the previous topic and this one?

24
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:06,640
I learned it from you.

25
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,440
I plan to open a travel agency in Nan'an.

26
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,700
Don't you have a tour guide certificate?

27
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,060
Do you want to join?

28
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,960
Nonsense. You're opening a travel agency,

29
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,640
not a self-employed business.

30
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,800
You have to register a company yourself and be the legal representative.

31
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,680
I know.

32
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:29,640
I've already consulted about the registration policies.

33
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:31,200
And the savings I have

34
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:35,020
are just enough to pay the deposit and registered capital.

35
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:35,920
Wait.

36
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:38,880
This novel costs hundreds of thousands.

37
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:40,240
Where did you get so much money?

38
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,160
She's stingy.

39
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,140
I'm just cheap.

40
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:42,880
Go on.

41
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,440
It's like this, sister.

42
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:46,240
After paying this sum,

43
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,240
I won't have any money to rent a place.

44
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,240
So,

45
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,640
I want you to use the vacant shop on the first floor

46
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,640
as a share based on the normal annual rent.

47
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,360
When we make a profit,

48
00:02:56,640 --> 00:02:58,600
you get dividends. You don't have to pay,

49
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,040
and you can revitalize the venue.

50
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,600
Besides, didn't you work as an operator in a travel agency for two years?

51
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,880
You can be our manager.

52
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:04,680
Wait.

53
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,400
I haven't agreed yet.

54
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,920
She's waiting for you to agree.

55
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,780
What does this have to do with you?

56
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:11,210
Let me explain, sister.

57
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,760
He is also my employee.

58
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:15,480
The policy requires

59
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:18,880
at least three employees to hold tour guide certificates.

60
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:21,640
I have a tour guide certificate.

61
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:22,520
You agreed?

62
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:25,040
She also promised me a pie in the sky.

63
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,240
So you agreed?

64
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,180
I also read the business plan.

65
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,079
The plan is here.

66
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,020
I thought about it.

67
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:37,040
Let's merge the customers of our homestay

68
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,560
with the travel agency.

69
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:42,360
If our guests need to travel,

70
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,560
you can recommend our routes to them.

71
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,730
This way, you can earn extra money.

72
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:49,440
There are so many large travel agencies in Nan'an.

73
00:03:49,440 --> 00:03:51,360
How could it be your small company's turn?

74
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,360
It will be.

75
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,800
Those large travel agencies

76
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,880
recruit large groups of dozens of people.

77
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:56,920
What we do is

78
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:59,880
small group special tours for one to six people.

79
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:02,360
In short, military-style tourism.

80
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,080
But don't worry, Sis.

81
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:06,210
We are not really going to be soldiers.

82
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,840
Is it possible that I surf the internet too?

83
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:15,760
Let me calculate for you, Sis.

84
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,620
It's like this.

85
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,880
If we can start

86
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,640
30 groups every month,

87
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,040
two people per group,

88
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,880
the profit per capita is 200.

89
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,160
The lowest monthly net profit

90
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,560
is 12,000.

91
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,480
That is 144,000 a year.

92
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,160
Your venue's annual rent,

93
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,520
including the accommodation fee for Zhang Yang and me,

94
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,320
make it 60,000.

95
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:31,640
Yes.

96
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:32,640
Calculated by shares,

97
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,170
you account for 15 percent,

98
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,560
and can get 21,600 at the end of the year.

99
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,960
It's better than leaving it empty, right?

100
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,280
I invest with technology,

101
00:04:40,280 --> 00:04:41,640
also counted as 15 percent.

102
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,480
Who asked you?

103
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:46,120
Nowadays, where can you find such a good deal

104
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,240
that the annual venue rent plus the accommodation for you two

105
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,480
only costs 60,000?

106
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:50,880
You can't find it.

107
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,440
So I plan...

108
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,120
I plan to keep begging you.

109
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,080
I beg you.

110
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,080
Please, Sis.

111
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,240
I'm begging you.

112
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,360
I will keep begging you.

113
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,240
I'll keep begging you, Sis.

114
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,520
I'll beg you every day when I wake up.

115
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,800
I'll beg you until you agree.

116
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,720
Okay, fine.

117
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,000
Alright.

118
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,560
If you don't get the commission from the scenic area,

119
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:10,290
the cost won't come down at all.

120
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:12,940
How about this?

121
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:15,440
You get the commission contract first,

122
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:18,570
and then I will issue the lease contract. How about that?

123
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:23,800
Okay.

124
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,680
Deal.

125
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,360
Deal.

126
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,580
I'm done. Take this with you when the time comes.

127
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:45,370
We need to change our approach.

128
00:06:46,440 --> 00:06:47,700
Trade zero commission

129
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:50,040
for free tours and ticket discounts.

130
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,080
I'll go right now.

131
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:52,840
Sister.

132
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:55,159
Do you think you're rushing to a gig?

133
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,800
First to the Ancient Residences,

134
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:58,600
then to Zheng Chenggong Memorial Hall,

135
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,240
and finally to Qingjing Taoyuan.

136
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,000
Slow down.

137
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,440
Hurry up.

138
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,720
Sister, come with me now.

139
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,580
We need to take a breather.

140
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,560
Don't call me sister.

141
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,120
Let's go.

142
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,480
What? I'm not going.

143
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,530
Aren't we taking pictures?

144
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,840
Not every beautiful moment

145
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:33,880
needs a picture.

146
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,600
Just like now,

147
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,400
you can stop and rest when you're tired.

148
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,240
There's a mountain called Echo Valley.

149
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:50,920
If you shout into the valley,

150
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:54,320
and if it's something that will happen in the future,

151
00:07:54,320 --> 00:07:55,800
the valley will echo.

152
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,120
Lately,

153
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:03,090
I feel like I've been shouting desperately into the valley,

154
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:04,640
but there's no echo at all.

155
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:08,720
Then try shouting a few times now.

156
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:11,800
This isn't Echo Valley.

157
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,600
As long as you want,

158
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,680
there will be an echo.

159
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:15,410
Give it a try.

160
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:16,660
You think I'm a kid?

161
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,240
I'm handsome!

162
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,880
Handsome...

163
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:30,540
An echo you make yourself doesn't count!

164
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:35,720
I want to live my life freely and happily!

165
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:38,360
Life... life...

166
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,560
My startup succeeds!

167
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:56,000
Succeeds... ceeds...

168
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,600
That counts now, right?

169
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,800
I buy a house in full!

170
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:08,360
In full... full...

171
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:13,320
Zhang Yang won't slack off at work!

172
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,400
Won't!

173
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,800
That won't do. I'll be slacking off for the rest of my life.

174
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,440
No slacking!

175
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,600
Slack off! No slacking!

176
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,240
No slacking!

177
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,400
All the plans are here for you to review.

178
00:09:58,400 --> 00:10:00,000
Okay. The plan is approved.

179
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:00,760
Thank you.

180
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:01,890
Happy cooperation.

181
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:07,600
It's just satisfactory.

182
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,960
Before your company opens,

183
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,960
remember to find me a receptionist.

184
00:10:14,800 --> 00:10:17,040
Does this mean you support it?

185
00:10:17,040 --> 00:10:20,040
I support it.

186
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,400
Are you that happy?

187
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,360
I've made it clear,

188
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:24,490
you must find me a receptionist first.

189
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:27,400
No problem. I guarantee to complete the task.

190
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,600
What we need to do now is,

191
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:40,040
hire a receptionist for the homestay.

192
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,120
Second,

193
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:42,960
find someone with a tour guide certificate.

194
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,720
Third is to buy furniture

195
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,560
and clean up.

196
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,800
The recruitment ad for the receptionist has been posted.

197
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:54,720
As for cleaning and buying furniture,

198
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,920
we can wait until we hire someone

199
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:57,980
to make a decision.

200
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,400
This way,

201
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,130
they can share some of the work.

202
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,880
Then the top priority now

203
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,760
is to hire a new person.

204
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,360
But it's the end of the year,

205
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:08,240
there are already few people looking for jobs,

206
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:11,440
and we need to find someone with a tour guide certificate.

207
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,200
Tour guide certificate?

208
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,480
I have a suitable candidate.

209
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,280
I refuse.

210
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,440
So direct.

211
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,240
Sorry, that's just me.

212
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,320
But as far as I know,

213
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,880
your sales at the store aren't ideal.

214
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,440
She means

215
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:34,540
she thinks there's room to improve your income.

216
00:11:35,160 --> 00:11:36,800
Your boss wants you to resign,

217
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,840
but you didn't agree.

218
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:40,920
I can help you get your severance pay.

219
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,360
Then you can join the travel agency

220
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,040
seamlessly,

221
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,440
with no employment gap.

222
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,970
But you don't actually need me.

223
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:49,240
You just need someone with a tour guide certificate.

224
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:51,360
And I prefer seeing my customers every day.

225
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,240
become more beautiful in my hands.

226
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,040
We need you.

227
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,320
For our travel agency's small group tours,

228
00:12:04,320 --> 00:12:07,440
we plan to offer a free travel photography package initially

229
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,640
to expand our market.

230
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,240
Once our customer base is stable,

231
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,800
we will turn this travel photography makeup

232
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:13,460
into a separate paid service.

233
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,240
By then,

234
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,440
you won't need to be a tour guide.

235
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:18,120
You just need to use your makeup skills.

236
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,800
Exactly. Look,

237
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:21,040
if a tourist

238
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,240
chooses our small group tour,

239
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:24,000
the first thing they might ask is,

240
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,040
'Can you book Ms. Tang for me?'

241
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,000
Exactly.

242
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,840
Chiming in with each other,

243
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,240
sounding so convincing.

244
00:12:31,800 --> 00:12:33,400
Anyway,

245
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:36,360
if you can get me the maximum compensation...

246
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:37,960
When it comes to money,

247
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,240
you can rest assured.

248
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,760
I'm a professional.

249
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:41,600
Are you a lawyer?

250
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,800
Of course not.

251
00:12:42,800 --> 00:12:43,960
She's just cheap.

252
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,280
Hello. I'm Lawyer Yang.

253
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:00,080
Here's the thing. On our side...

254
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,120
Welcome to the team.

255
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,050
I look forward to working with you.

256
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:22,920
Thank you for these past few days.

257
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:24,240
It was just for profit.

258
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:25,160
You don't owe me anything.

259
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,220
No need to thank me.

260
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,160
She's fun, isn't she?

261
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,760
Don't call me sister.
